ad", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/stolik/", "num_games_owned": 185, "num_reviews": 196, "playtime_forever": 706, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 518, "last_played": 1430861370, "avatar": "bb3d8927a13239e0762174ab83a121e5080d7eb7"}, "language": "english", "review": "60 min run and tons of enemies on the screen - game crashes. 10/10 would crash again.", "timestamp_created": 1430430075, "timestamp_updated": 1782051265, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.465561568737030029", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "15628706", "author": {"steamid": "76561197976555566", "personaname": "richdog", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197976555566/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 6112, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4580, "last_played": 1723242153, "avatar": "7a04ecf542888f3eed1dc642e50774383cf83b67"}, "language": "english", "review": "Amazingly addictive game. Seriously you will be up nights trying to get the achievements and unlockables. Took a \"risk\" on this when it came out despite the crappy trailer, and have loved it ever since. I see this routinely for sale and highly recommend picking it up. It is very worth the 10$ price as you could easily put 100 hours into the super deep and random gameplay. I would put this one up with Binding of Isaac for its random goodness and addictive nature as you try to have the perfect \"run\".  A few negatives:  Some of the items toward the end seem not worth the effort to get. And some of the characters you find later on arent that great either. Finding the artifacts is fun and challenging but can break the game pretty easily with them as they can overpower you.\n\nWill have the difficulty meter laugh at me again  10/10", "timestamp_created": 1430429666, "timestamp_updated": 1430429666, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.483870983123779297", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "15625529", "author": {"steamid": "76561198061388026", "personaname": "Admiral Bratan", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Simsari/", "num_games_owned": 110, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 2691, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1129, "last_played": 1599517371, "avatar": "7518a48ebfbc4b9d4db160a345e95c463ac9b317"}, "language": "english", "review": "\"Sin Hund ghört mer immer.\" by Luis Roth", "timestamp_created": 1430414809, "timestamp_updated": 1430414809, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 15, "count": 1}]}]}